--  UI3R  v2.0  |  glass iOS  |  executor-safe  |  Roblox Luau
--  Mejoras vs v1:
--    * Toggle / Slider / Dropdown tienen callback onChange
--    * Dropdown popup parented al gui root (sin clipping)
--    * Watermark/background robusto (sin Content.fromUri)
